        Returns
        -------
        :class:`Value`, :py:`unsigned(len(self) + 2 ** len(other) - 1)`
            If :py:`self` is unsigned.
        :class:`Value`, :py:`signed(len(self) + 2 ** len(other) - 1)`
            If :py:`self` is signed.

        Raises
        ------
        :exc:`TypeError`
            If :py:`other` is signed.
        """
